       "quote": "Low usage alert | Customer classified as low-usage | Send email + create Salesforce task | SF task subject must contain customer name"
      },
      {
       "id": "ws_alert_rules:preamble:6",
       "text": "No alert for non-low | normal-usage or high-usage | Tag only, no email, no SF task | Only low-usage triggers alerts",
       "types": [
